With these four simple patches:

- We swap out the caret icons for Add16 (plus) and Subtract16 (minus).  
- All existing class names (`up-icon` / `down-icon`) and click handlers remain, so both mobile and desktop variants continue to work.  
- No need to touch the vanilla-JS file, since it only cares about those class names, not the icon artwork itself.
